OL,3,GNEWSANew city centre half-marathon
OL,4,Acoming to Norwich
OL,5,
OL,6,FA race organiser is hoping to unite
OL,7,FNorwich with another running event in
OL,8,Fthe city's sporting calendar.
OL,10,FEPIC Norfolk organises events including
OL,11,Fdistances of 5km, 10km and
OL,12,Fhalf-marathons across Norfolk and
OL,13,FSuffolk.
OL,15,FSteven Hitcham said its inaugural
OL,16,Fhalf-marathon event, taking place next
OL,17,Fyear, would be the first half-marathon
OL,18,Fto take place in the city centre since
OL,19,F1993.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
